  "summary": "<p>Days after the midterms, caravans of illegal aliens are already marching north to the U.S. — and they’re counting on Democrats to let them in. Why wouldn’t they? Congressional Democrats are vowing to abolish ICE, dismantle DHS, stop deportations, and hand out amnesty while border-state Democrats cut off cooperation on immigration enforcement. It’s the same [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/democrats-will-help-us-caravans-march-north-as-dems-vow-to-reopen-the-border-president-trump-wont-let-it-happen/\">“Democrats Will Help Us”: Caravans March North as Dems Vow to Reopen the Border. President Trump Won’t Let It Happen.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
